            },
            "body": "> LGTM. Any perf/acc data?\r\n\r\nqwen3-8b test on CRI:\r\n- total throughput: 6106.07 -> 6441.19 (+~5%)\r\n- acc(gsm8k): 0.8719 -> 0.8650 (acc is on par)\r\n```\r\nvllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-8B --max-model-len 8192 -tp 1 --quantization fp8 --port 8111 --enforce-eager --no-enable-prefix-caching\r\n\r\n\r\nvllm bench serve --backend vllm --model Qwen/Qwen3-8B \\\r\n                                               --base-url http://localhost:8111 \\\r\n                                               --dataset-name random --random-input-len 1024 --random-output-len 256 \\\r\n                                               --num-prompts 200 --max-concurrency 32 \\\r\n                                               --ignore-eos --percentile-metrics ttft,tpot,itl,e2el \\\r\n                                               --save-result --result-filename per_token_c32.json --num-warmups 32\r\n\r\nlm_eval --model local-chat-completions --task gsm8k --num_fewshot 5 --batch_size 1 --model_args \"model=Qwen/Qwen3-8B,base_url=http://loca\r\nlhost:8111/v1/chat/completions,max_gen_toks=4096,num_concurrent=64,timeout=5000,max_retries=5\" --apply_chat_template --output_path ./lm_eval_output --log_samples\r\n\r\n```",
